                "question": "<p>Reorder the steps you should follow  to properly define a problem.</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">1. Identify who is most affected by the problem</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">2. Reframe the problem to get at the most urgent and important root cause</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">3. Articulate the root causes of the problem</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">4. Narrow the scope from a large issue to a specific problem</p>\n"
              },
