                "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\">To use LASSO for a problem definition, I will ask myself the following questions:</p>\n\n\n\t\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Have I limited the scope?</p>\n\t\n\t\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Have I described something actionable?</p>\n\t\n\t\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Have I described something specific?</p>\n\t\n\t\n\t<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Have I described the problem that will be supported?</p>\n\t\n\n\n<p>Have I identified a problem owner?</p>\n"
